"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[74646],{74646:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/four-knocks.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Four Knocks\\"\\n          author=\\"Casey\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Influential\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2021-10-28\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791191056136\\"\\n          rating=3.5\\n          tags=\\"thriller\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI went to the counter to pay at the ```Aladin Secondhand Bookstore```, and it was introduced as a ```book recommended by Aladin staff``` next to it, so I bought it inadvertently.  \\n<br>\\nThe case itself and the fun elements are good, but it\'s a bit light somewhere.  \\nHowever, the parts that divided the <mark>investigation</mark> and the <mark>monologues</mark> of the suspects helped with immersion.  \\nHowever, the ```monologue``` parts become somewhat loose.  \\n<br>\\nThe fact that the characters are denoted by room numbers like 301 and 302 instead of names seems to bring to life the background of a desolate ```studio apartment village``` well.  \\nI liked that I didn\'t have to memorize the characters\' names.  \\n<br>\\nThe path to the twist is not smooth enough and is somewhat forced.\\n"}')}}]);